{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"LoggingDestinations"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"LoggingDestinations","externalID":"LoggingDestinations","role":"collection"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Destinations","anchor":"Destinations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/loggingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoggingDestinations\/documentation\/LoggingDestinations\/LoggerDestination"},{"text":" turns each record into one log entry at the level you choose, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"info"},{"text":" by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default. The message is the event’s name. The metadata holds the event’s description under","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"text":", the time it was tracked under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event.timestamp"},{"text":", its call site under OpenTelemetry’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"text":" names, and every value of its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" under the value’s key name. The entry’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own file, function and line are the event’s call site, so a handler that prints them points at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"track"},{"text":" call rather than at this module.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlin